How to build:
- Generate with CMake to start, then just play.

How to play?:
- Move with WASD.
- Attack/Interact with left mouse button.
- ESC to exit a screen or open the pause menu.

On the design:
I wanted to find various ways to make this project feel unique in comparison to the others.
That made me add various layers of complexity to the combat specifically:
1 - You have archers that attack from up to 3 tiles away.
2 - You have mages that randomly teleport mid-combat. And a boss form of them.
3 - You have a boss that can move up to 2 tiles each turn.
